    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>Gulthias blights are ancient plants warped by evil that drink blood and ravage the land around them, often spawning lesser blights that serve them. Their name recalls their origin: the first of them was a tree that sprouted from the stake driven through the heart of the vampire Gulthias. To these blights, every creature is either a servant or fertilizer for their corruption.</p>",
