        "description": {
          "value": "<p><em>Constitution Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=n0QZ0X9NWNyjP4HU]], one Huge or smaller creature the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} can see within 30 feet. <em>Failure:</em> [[/damage 2d6 + 7 average type=necrotic]] damage, and the target has the &amp;Reference[Grappled apply=false] condition (escape DC 17) from one of six roots. Until the grapple ends, the target has the &amp;Reference[Restrained apply=false] condition and takes [[/damage 4d6 average type=necrotic]] damage at the start of each of its turns. The target's Hit Point maximum decreases by an amount equal to the Necrotic damage taken, and the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} regains Hit Points equal to that amount.</p>",
